# Results
results/**
!results/
!results/**/
!results/**/.gitkeep
# Post-KBS hardening: EVERY CSV pinned by results/tables/MANIFEST.sha256 is versioned,
# so a fresh clone passes `make verify-hashes` from repository contents alone. All CSVs
# under results/tables are pinned (verify_results_manifest reports 0 unpinned extras);
# unpinned generated .tex side-products there stay unversioned. The machine-verdict JSONs
# of the two registered replications ship as well.
!results/tables/**/*.csv
!results/tables/symmetric_pipeline_dynamic_001/*.json
!results/tables/size_matched_own_transformer_001/*.json
!results/tables/MANIFEST.sha256
# final-kbs P10: the machine-readable final manifest ships with the artifact
!results/final_manifest.json
# table -> protocol -> config ledger referenced by README/PROVENANCE (derived, small)
!results/final_experiment_ledger.csv

